                <rule name="Plague Carrier" id="198c-d43d-c116-945e" hidden="false">
                  <description>At the end of the Chaos Shooting phase, any model that is within 6&quot; of the vehicle is affected. Roll a D6 for each model, and on a rol of a 6 it takes a wound with normal saves allowed (but not cover saves). Models with Mark of Nurgle and all Daemon Packs, Possessed, Daemon Beasts and Great Daemons are immune.</description>
                </rule>
